  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Laying the foundation for VaMoz Digital!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The proposed project `Laying the foundation for &#xbf;VaMoz Digital!&#xbf; aims to contribute to the implementation of the Action entitled &#xbf;VaMoz Digital!&#xbf; which seeks to contribute to Mozambique&#xbf;s inclusive growth focused on digital transformation. Project interventions are designed to align, be complementary and re-enforceAICS (Italian Cooperation work).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
